  "Description": {
    "Cost": 8236376,
    "UIName": "Schiltron L",
    "Id": "vehicledef_SCHILTRON_L",
    "Name": "Schiltron L",
    "Details": "Designed as an Omni vehicle, the Schiltron uses modular weapon ports similar to those used on OmniMechs allowing it to be quickly reconfigured for a variety of mission parameters. Carrying only 10 tons of armor, the Schiltron is forced to stay well out of the line of fire, something that a top speed of 54 km/h does not always make possible. The base chassis carries a C3 Computer, as well as a Guardian ECM Suite.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       365     40\n<b>Left</b>         210     40\n<b>Right</b>       210     40\n<b>Rear</b>        125     40\n<b>Turret</b>      280     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      1190    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Tacticon TC7000</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Schiltron"
  },
